==== VERSION
libpdx-audit 1.1.0 (2026-09-02, LA.M2-003 rollup). Rolls up the
post-1.0.0 correctness/enhancement pass: `#11` + `#12` coordinated
`PdxAuditRecord@0.1 → @0.2` wire revision documented in [[cref: WIRE-
FORMAT]] above (256-byte hybrid record with inline strings + globally-
unique `audit_id`); `ENH-003…008` API-surface widenings
(`audit_record_output` re-entrant from OUTPUT, `audit_rearm`,
fail-closed `audit_can_emit_output`, `audit_last_error`,
`audit_broker_failure_cause`, `caps.decl` refresh); `#20..#24`
LA.M1 correctness pass (broker-bind fast-path fix, test-driver symbol
namespacing, `audit_last_error` + FNV-1a-64 known-vector test parity,
in-tree marshal harness); `#25..#29` LA.M2 release-cut wave (this
document's SYNOPSIS drift fix, manifest `audit-hdr-word` refresh, the
v1.1.0 rollup itself, architecture.md section reorder, STATUS.md
disclosure). Predecessor: 1.0.0 (2026-08-22, R49 wave, M5-001 signed
release).
